      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings: EPS misses analyst expectations",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.97 (up from ₹2.46 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹32.9b (up 43% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹12.6b (up 36% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 38% (down from 40% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue was in line with analyst estimates. Earnings per share (EPS) missed analyst estimates by 13%. Revenue is forecast to grow 28% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 23% growth forecast for the Consumer Finance industry in India.",
